  "changelog": "Initial release of ECS Linux OS troubleshooting skill for Alibaba Cloud.\n\n- Provides structured, step-by-step diagnosis for Alibaba Cloud ECS Linux OS abnormal issues (e.g., boot failures, login problems, network/disk issues, performance anomalies).\n- Enforces strict troubleshooting workflow with 6 progressive phases and a progress checklist.\n- Validates user input for safety and correctness before any remote command execution.\n- Uses only documented aliyun CLI subcommands for remote investigation; custom commands are not permitted.\n- Includes session-specific user-agent tracing for all aliyun CLI operations.\n- Not applicable to non-Alibaba Cloud ECS, non-Linux OS, or control-plane-only issues.",
